<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cincinnati Bell started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cincinnati Bell started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it initiated coverage of Cincinnati Bell Inc as outperform.</p>
<p>-- said it set a $71 a share price target.</p>
<p>-- expects Cincinnati Bell to earn $2.80 a share in 1997 and $3.30 a share in 1998.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
